{"text": "From: \u2018Samantha Beers/R3/USEPA/US\n\nSent 10/22/2010 11:08:32 AM\nTo: Shawn Garvin/R3/USEPAUS@EPA; Wiliam EarlyiR3/USEPA/US; Megan MackeyiR3/USEPAUS\nce: Troy JordarR3/USEPA/US@EPA; Chip Hosford/RS/USEPAUS@EPA\n\u2018Subject: Fw: Marcellus gas driling photo essay\nBill and Shawn:\n\n\u2018Attached please find material from a citizen in Washington Towns!\nShale operations in her community. [\n\nEx. 5 - Deliberative EX. 5 - Deliberative |\n\nItis interesting to note the circuitous route this took in getting to region 3.\n\nPA documenting her concems regarding Marcellus\n\nSamantha Philips Beers,\nDirector,\nEnforcement, Compliance and Environmental Justice\nEPA Region 3\n215-814-2627\nForwarded by Samantha Beers/R3/USEPAJUS on 10/22/2010 10:36 AM \u2014~\n\nKenneth Gigliello/DCIUSEPAUS\nTo Samantha Beers/R3/USEPAUS@EPA, Troy\nTree Wer AM, Jordan/RS/IUSEPNUS@EPA, Chip\nHosford/RG/USEPAJUS@EPA\nco Mike Gaydosh/R8/USEPAJUS@EPA, Jerry\n\u2018Saunders/R6/USEPAUS@EPA, Stephen\nGirein/REUSEPAUS@EPA\nSubject Fw: Marcellus gas diiling photo essay\n\nSamanthalTroy/Chip: | don't know if this was sent to you since it came from the Region II Regional Administrator. If\nyou click on the pdf file there is an comprehensive description from a private citizen with some excellent photos regarding\n\u2018some of potential problems associated with oil and gas drilling in Pennsylvania,\n\nForwarded by Kenneth Giglieli(DC/USEPAUS on 10/22/2010 10:20 AM\n\ncom: Kathleen Malone/R2/USEPAUS\nTo: Adam Kushner/DC/USEPAJUS@EPA\nCe: Bemadette Rappold/DC/USEPA/US@EPA, Kenneth Gigiello/DC/USEPA/US@EPA\n10/22/2010 07:54 AM\n*: Fw: Marcellus gas driling photo essay\n\nMr Kushner,\n\nMy Regional Administrator wanted me to send you the pdf on the super mister. The link for some reason did not work\nsince the % actually need to be there. However, the photo essay is all over the web so I downloaded and attached it for\nyour convenience. If you have problems opening it let me know. | am ccing two members of the OECA SIT team for On-\n\u2018Shore Gas Extraction & Production Initiative so they are aware. | will also be contacting other regions to see if they have\nother examples.\n\nKathleen Malone-Bogusky\nR2 Shale Gas Extraction & Production Coordinator\nR2 Federal Facilities Program Manager\n\nDIM0039857 DIMo039857",
